  "note": "Generic education controls require explicit educationDegree and exact educationExpectedSchool; doctoral* nonempty keys preserve explicit doctoral compatibility, while empty values request no education writes. Scoped education completion matches full degree/school/start/end identity across variable existing cards (max 50), including repeated degrees; observed menu options remain bounded. Papers use current title/index anchors with max 50 existing rows. Practice helpers retain their distinct one-card or explicit reuse/add scopes and observed monthpicker panels. No save/submit. Upload auto-parsing requires independent replacement authorization and does not verify parsed correctness. Generic and legacy education text both require an explicit school anchor (educationExpectedSchool or legacy doctoralSchool); degree and school are rechecked after preparation and before each shared text write. Legacy text without an anchor stops. Same-URL card identity changes are not accepted."
